OL,3,ABurnham to call for closer EU ties in
OL,4,ACommons statement as MPs return from
OL,5,Arecess
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is set to make a statement
OL,8,Fto MPs as Parliament returns from
OL,9,Fconference recess - you'll be able to
OL,10,Fwatch live above
OL,12,FThe PM is expected to say it would be a
OL,13,F"dereliction of duty" to turn down a
OL,14,Fcloser relationship with the EU - if it
OL,15,Fcan be negotiated with Brussels
OL,17,FBurnham will argue it is time to "face
OL,18,Fup to the reality that Brexit has done
OL,19,Fmore harm than good"
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
