OL,3,ABurnham to call for closer EU ties in
OL,4,ACommons statement as MPs return from
OL,5,Arecess
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe PM told the BBC two weeks ago it
OL,8,Fwas "possible" a future Labour
OL,9,Fmanifesto could promise a new
OL,10,Freferendum
OL,12,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch said
OL,13,Fat her party's conference last week it
OL,14,Fwas "a terrible idea" to "reopen the
OL,15,FBrexit debate"
OL,17,FOn Sunday, Burnham told a podcast it
OL,18,Fwas "clear" Russia had interfered in
OL,19,Fthe Brexit vote. Reform leader Nigel
OL,20,FFarage has called him "a liar", telling
OL,21,Fa press conference "there was no
OL,22,FRussian interference"
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
